11
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,900
Reverse Story.

12
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:37,720
(Reverse Story)
You'll split into teams of four.

13
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,280
Each round, you'll pass along

14
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,400
a character

15
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,160
doing something in a certain mood.

16
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:42,680
For example,

17
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:43,400
Zhuangzhuang's mom

18
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:45,040
sadly playing dodgeball.

19
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,080
Within the time limit,

20
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,480
each player instructs the next person

21
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,720
to act out the clue.

22
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:50,960
The next person

23
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,120
figures it out and passes it on.

24
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,320
The last person guesses.

25
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:56,560
The team that gets
the most characters right wins.

26
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,760
Let's do an extra round.

27
00:00:59,060 --> 00:01:00,000
(Shen Teng's Team, Jia Bing's Team)

28
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,720
Let's start from here.

29
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,120
(Teng, Anyu, Churan, Chengcheng)
First, second, third, fourth.

30
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:02,480
Okay.

31
