Time to get serious,

32
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:03,840
guys.

33
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:06,160
He's taking this seriously.

34
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,600
(A caterpillar greedily sneaks spicy hot pot)
Okay, countdown starts now.

35
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:08,420
(A caterpillar
greedily sneaks spicy hot pot)

36
