70
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,160
Let me see.

71
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,440
This is...

72
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:08,440
Eating?

73
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,240
It's done eating.

74
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,360
The mouth.

75
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:13,760
Uncomfortable.

76
00:02:14,880 --> 00:02:15,360
But satisfying.

77
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,880
Uncomfortable.

78
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,320
Eating spicy food.

79
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:18,760
