83
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:25,400
Besides the spicy food.

84
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,120
(That's none of your business)

85
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:26,480
What else?

86
00:02:26,580 --> 00:02:27,640
(What else?)

87
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,560
Eating spicy food.

88
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,300
(That's all I can tell you)

89
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,940
(And now he's acting it out himself)

90
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:33,380
(What else could it be
besides spicy food?)

91
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,320
Alright, time's up!

92
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:35,960
