Stick my butt up and wriggle forward?

195
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,480
Don't put any weight on your hands.

196
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:56,800
Put your hands behind you.

197
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,760
